; Each SubViewport clear mode, with canvas content and with 3D content. The content is red at alpha
; 0.25 over the left half of a 32x32 target, sampled by a 100x100 TextureRect, and a viewport
; renders every frame. ALWAYS clears every render. NEVER draws the canvas over the bytes of the
; renders before, so it builds up toward the colour. ONCE clears the first render and then acts as
; NEVER. A 3D render repaints its target over opaque black where no clear set the colour
; (`renderer_scene_render_rd.cpp:1464-1469`). Rows: canvas on an opaque target, canvas on a
; transparent target over white, 3D on an opaque target. Measured with Godot 4.6.3 `--mode 2d`.

